# <%= line(@post.title) %>

<%= Date.to_iso8601(@post.date) %> · <%= line(@post.author) %>

<%= if @post.description != "", do: line(@post.description) <> "\n" %>
The post is published as HTML at <%= absolute("/blog/" <> @post.slug) %>. Its sections:

<%= for entry <- @post.toc do %>
<%= String.duplicate("  ", max(entry.level - 2, 0)) %>- <%= line(entry.title) %>
<% end %>

<%= trailer() %>
